new-lg4ff-dkms (0.5.0+git20261010.2092db1-1+stereo3d6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The udev rule no longer hides a control it could not set (ORDER 346f-1,
    audit 343 U27, Daniel 2026-11-01: "nothing we do should silently fail"):
    its "chown -f ... || true" commands run sparky-stereo-wheel-access, which
    skips a control the wheel's model does not have and says, through
    sparky-stereo-problems, one the model has and cannot be set for the games
    group. Depends: sparky-stereo-wheel-access (>= 0.1.0). Upstream has no
    fix for this: the Fanatec rules keep "|| true" and the other two drivers
    ship no rules.

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 01:30:00 -0300

