new-lg4ff-dkms (0.5.0+git20261010.2092db1-1+stereo3d4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Leave the build's Lean Code records out of /usr/src: the source tree is
    copied with .sparky-lc excluded, as nvidia-kmod-open does. The earlier
    builds shipped the folder (the native pass's source report and authored
    copies, 9 to 20 files), whose report named the toolkit of that build (ORDER
    311).
  * Correction to +stereo3d3's second item: its binary packages were built
    fresh from that source (nothing compiles in this DKMS package), not re-
    projected from the +stereo3d2 HR companion (ORDER 311).
  * Built with the Lean Code toolkit 0.1.21 of build-repo main cb9f644: C and
    C++ files lose their comment-only lines, with no #line directive and no
    empty line where a comment was; dpkg-stereo --resolve finds a lean line's
    authored line by its content (ORDER 334).

